    {
      "id": "2858dfbb5f63bdb5d2e8cdc10f6bc78c7d8d721d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1164261992,
          "type": null,
          "body": "From [How to disable auto update to v. 4.x.x](https://ask.wireshark.org/question/29341/how-to-disable-auto-update-to-v-4xx/):  \n  \n```\nRunning on 64-bit Windows (22H2), build 22621, ...\n```\n\nShould  ([os_version_info.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/wsutil/os_version_info.c#L369))\n```\n\t\t\t\t\t} else if (win_version_info.dwBuildNumber == 22000) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tg_string_append_printf(str, \"Windows 11\");\n```\n\nbe `win_version_info.dwBuildNumber >= 22000` ?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/chuckcraft"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-11-08T15:20:31.084Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-11-08T15:20:31.084Z",
